{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f5d10269-0167-8faf-8777-60552ae900f9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T17:37:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice L. Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I am calling about a tree. It is down. Is this the right number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure is, I can help with that. Is the tree on a street or on private property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, please. One moment. [pause] My nephew is here. He helps me with the words."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in my yard. The roots came up out of the ground. All the roots. It fell in the storm, last weekend. Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the nor'easter. Yeah, we've had a lot of those. Is it blocking the road or the sidewalk at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not the road. It leans on the fence. Big hole in the ground now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty-five Admiral Kalbfus Road. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty-five Admiral Kalbfus, okay, writing that down. Any wires touching it, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires. I think no. Only the fence. [pause] I call this number because the office is closed now. It is after five. Your recording said this line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, City Hall's closed for the day, but this line's open for storm stuff. You did the right thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So who do I call? The city? The owner? The electric company? Who takes the tree away? I do not know here. Which one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. If it's on your own property and not in the road, usually the property owner is responsible for getting it cleared. The city handles trees in the street or on city land. The utility only comes if wires are involved. Do you own the house, or rent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait. [pause] I live there. My family owns. Me, I live there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that one's probably yours to deal with, and a private tree service would be who you'd call. But I'll note it here in case a crew's going by and it turns out part of it's over the right of way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. So I pay. That is not good news. The storm was not my fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, it's a pain, no question. Sorry it's not a better answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tree is on my beds also. The raised beds. I grow vegetables. I am making my seed order now, for spring. And now a tree in the garden."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's rough timing. If the roots are up over the beds, I'd get someone out sooner rather than later so you can get in there before planting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I will ask my nephew to look for a company. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. If it shifts toward the road or you see a wire down, call us right back. You have a good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T17:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good night."
    }
  ],
